<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>The marks of <m>{27}</m> learners in a county mock examination, in order, are</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Positions 1 to 10</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{15}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{17}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{20}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{23}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{25}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{26}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{34}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{38}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{40}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{44}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Positions 11 to 20</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{49}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{59}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{60}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{62}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{63}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{64}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{65}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{66}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{69}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{76}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Positions 21 to <m>{27}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{77}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{79}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{82}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{84}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{90}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{91}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{92}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"/><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"/><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"/></row></tabular><p>Give exact values.</p><p>(a) Find the decile <m>D_{ {9} }</m>.</p><div><m>D_{ {9} } =</m> <fillin characters="6" name="ans1"/>  </div><p>(b) Find the percentile <m>P_{ {20} }</m>.</p><div><m>P_{ {20} } =</m> <fillin characters="6" name="ans2"/>  </div></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>For a list of <m>n</m> values in order, the decile <m>D_k</m> is at position <m>\dfrac{k(n+1)}{10}</m> and the percentile <m>P_j</m> at <m>\dfrac{j(n+1)}{100}</m>. A position that is not a whole number lies between two values: go that fraction of the way from the lower value to the higher one.</p><p>(a) <m>n = {27}</m>, so <m>D_{ {9} }</m> is at position <m>\dfrac{ {9} \times {28} }{10} = {25.2}</m>: <me> {90} + {0.2} \times ({91} - {90}) = {90.2}</me></p><p>(b) <m>P_{ {20} }</m> is at position <m>\dfrac{ {20} \times {28} }{100} = {5.6}</m>: <me> {25} + {0.6} \times ({26} - {25}) = {25.6}</me></p></p></solution>
    <answer><p><m>\frac{451}{5}</m></p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>\frac{128}{5}</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>